      {
        "key": "k9km-k3dmCc24R1",
        "unstructured": "For any periodic potential, the set of all Bloch waves forms a complete basis   [25]. This implies that every normalized wave packet capable of propagating through the periodic potential can be represented as a superposition of Bloch waves.",
