      {
        "key": "k9km-k3dmCc33R1",
        "unstructured": "Throughout this paper, we assume that all allowed energy bands are separated by nonzero band gaps. That is, we do not consider exotic periodic potentials where certain band gaps vanish at specific quasimomentum values.",
