        "unstructured": "At the zone boundary, not all solutions to the time-independent Schrödinger equation have the Bloch-wave structure   [25, 35, 36, 37, 38], and the inclusion of the zone boundary in the support of the amplitudes ϕ(j)(κ) may require modifying the normalization condition   (14).",
